{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん最近一気に寒くなったけど元気ですかっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは雪ん子だから超元気っ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"健康とお肌の為にヨーグルトと豆乳をのんでるんだけど効果が現れてきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肌つるつるになってきたよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田にいた頃は化粧水しなくてもつるつるお肌だったのにな〜(´；Д；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かむばっく生駒ちゃんのつるつるお肌ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とどうでもよいお話から始まりましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/11/07/3098760/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん前回の質問に答えて下さってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果羽毛布団派の方が多かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんリッチね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも体にフィットするのも好きという意見もっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは布団から出るのが非常に厳しくなってきますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かいぬくぬく布団からの脱出はほぼ不可能(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、我々は行かねばならぬのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校に！会社にっ！仕事にっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共に行こうではないかっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、受験生の皆さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんも高校三年生！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生！"},{"type":